WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:30.500
In this verse, Lord Krishna emphasises

2
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.541
vairagya, detachment, and equanimity.

3
00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:40.750
In verse 13.10,

4
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:41.875
Lord Krishna speaks of three

5
00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:45.041
more important qualities.

6
00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:46.083
The first is

7
00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:50.000
detachment from family and
material possessions.

8
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.833
Vairagya does not mean neglecting

9
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.291
family duties.

10
00:00:54.291 --> 00:00:58.083
It means maintaining emotional distance

11
00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:00.458
so that attachment does not become

12
00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:02.791
a barrier to spiritual progress.

13
00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:03.875
A person fulfils

14
00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:05.125
family duties

15
00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:08.375
with love and care, but remains aware

16
00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:11.666
that worldly relationships are temporary

17
00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:15.333
and the supreme relationship is
with Lord Krishna.

18
00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:16.666
The second is

19
00:01:16.666 --> 00:01:20.416
freedom from excessive entanglement
with family.

20
00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:22.500
While natural affection

21
00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.208
for family is essential, excessive attachment

22
00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:29.458
binds the soul to material existence.

23
00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:31.583
Freedom from entanglement means

24
00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:33.000
recognising

25
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.125
that relationships should become a means

26
00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:36.583
to develop devotion,

27
00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:39.666
not a barrier on the spiritual path.

28
00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:40.625
The third is

29
00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:44.333
equanimity in favourable and
unfavourable circumstances.

30
00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:46.208
Equanimity means

31
00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:50.041
remaining calm and undisturbed

32
00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:52.833
when facing desirable or undesirable situations.

33
00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:54.041
One who has this quality

34
00:01:54.041 --> 00:01:56.416
understands that both joy and sorrow

35
00:01:56.416 --> 00:02:00.208
are temporary and maintains composure.

36
00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:02.875
They see all events as part of Lord Krishna's

37
00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:05.250
divine plan.

38
00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:13.083
Have you noticed

39
00:02:13.083 --> 00:02:16.583
how much pain arises

40
00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:19.250
when things do not go as you imagined,

41
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:24.000
when a professional step fails,

42
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.375
when a relationship changes,

43
00:02:26.375 --> 00:02:30.625
or when you do not meet your
own expectations?

44
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:33.666
It is not the situation alone that causes sorrow,

45
00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:37.541
but the attachment to the belief

46
00:02:37.541 --> 00:02:38.916
that things

47
00:02:38.916 --> 00:02:43.166
must go as we wished.

48
00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:45.000
But what if

49
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.666
you could care deeply,

50
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:52.958
give your best,

51
00:02:52.958 --> 00:02:58.916
and still remain emotionally steady

52
00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:00.333
even when the result

53
00:03:00.333 --> 00:03:04.375
does not match your hopes?

54
00:03:04.375 --> 00:03:08.458
This is the power of vairagya, detachment.

55
00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:12.458
It does not mean giving up.

56
00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:15.583
It means letting go of the need

57
00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:19.916
to control every outcome.

58
00:03:19.916 --> 00:03:25.208
When you practise even a little vairagya,

59
00:03:25.208 --> 00:03:28.750
you create a gap between what happens

60
00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:35.875
and how you respond to it.

61
00:03:35.875 --> 00:03:38.000
You begin to understand

62
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:41.291
that your worth is not tied to a promotion,

63
00:03:41.291 --> 00:03:45.166
a person, or a fixed plan.

64
00:03:45.166 --> 00:03:47.916
Life will have its ups and downs,

65
00:03:47.916 --> 00:03:49.833
it always does.

66
00:03:49.833 --> 00:03:53.416
But when you do not cling tightly

67
00:03:53.416 --> 00:03:58.166
to how things should be,

68
00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:01.958
you flow with greater ease.

69
00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:03.958
This is not indifference,

70
00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:06.083
it is emotional strength.

71
00:04:06.083 --> 00:04:10.208
Vairagya helps you stay calm, wise,

72
00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:13.375
and steady,

73
00:04:13.375 --> 00:04:17.333
whatever life brings your way.

74
00:04:17.333 --> 00:04:19.708
Only then does peace

75
00:04:19.708 --> 00:04:22.500
become your natural state,

76
00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:26.291
not just a passing moment.

77
00:04:31.041 --> 00:04:33.166
Do you know

78
00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:34.916
the difference between love

79
00:04:34.916 --> 00:04:40.000
and emotional dependence?

80
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.625
Love is healthy,

81
00:04:42.625 --> 00:04:47.083
clear, and caring.

82
00:04:47.083 --> 00:04:50.000
But excessive attachment

83
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.250
makes us blind.

84
00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.416
When we are too deeply entangled

85
00:04:55.416 --> 00:04:58.250
with someone in the family,

86
00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:00.916
as Dhritarashtra was

87
00:05:00.916 --> 00:05:03.458
with Duryodhana,

88
00:05:03.458 --> 00:05:08.500
we stop seeing things

89
00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.000
as they are.

90
00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.458
We justify

91
00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:15.708
their mistakes,

92
00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:20.083
ignore warning signs,

93
00:05:20.083 --> 00:05:23.291
and in the name of love,

94
00:05:23.291 --> 00:05:25.500
even cause harm to others.

95
00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:30.041
As a parent, you must certainly

96
00:05:30.041 --> 00:05:33.750
love your child deeply.

97
00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:38.541
But if that love becomes attachment

98
00:05:38.541 --> 00:05:43.125
where you can no longer see their mistakes,

99
00:05:43.125 --> 00:05:47.541
it can destroy their future.

100
00:05:47.541 --> 00:05:49.958
Real love means

101
00:05:49.958 --> 00:05:54.083
guiding them, correcting them,

102
00:05:54.083 --> 00:05:57.291
and saying 'no'

103
00:05:57.291 --> 00:06:00.000
when needed.

104
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.666
If your love keeps them

105
00:06:01.666 --> 00:06:04.250
on the right path,

106
00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.541
that is true love.

107
00:06:06.541 --> 00:06:11.166
In any relationship, when you become

108
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:14.291
too emotionally dependent,

109
00:06:14.291 --> 00:06:18.083
you lose your balance.

110
00:06:18.083 --> 00:06:20.875
You stop standing up

111
00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:24.083
for yourself.

112
00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:26.708
True relationship means

113
00:06:26.708 --> 00:06:30.416
caring for each other

114
00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:32.791
but with clear thinking

115
00:06:32.791 --> 00:06:37.250
and remaining aware of yourself.

116
00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:43.208
Anabhishvanga – freedom from entanglement –

117
00:06:43.208 --> 00:06:49.458
does not mean becoming emotionally distant.

118
00:06:49.458 --> 00:06:53.375
It means remaining grounded in love,

119
00:06:53.375 --> 00:06:57.625
without losing your inner clarity.

120
00:06:57.625 --> 00:06:59.625
When your relationships

121
00:06:59.625 --> 00:07:02.291
are rooted in love

122
00:07:02.291 --> 00:07:05.125
and guided by wisdom,

123
00:07:05.125 --> 00:07:09.708
your family becomes a place of strength

124
00:07:09.708 --> 00:07:11.125
- not weakness.

125
00:07:15.583 --> 00:07:18.000
Everyone knows –

126
00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.166
in the professional world, every action

127
00:07:21.166 --> 00:07:25.416
is done to achieve a goal.

128
00:07:25.416 --> 00:07:27.625
You may wonder –

129
00:07:27.625 --> 00:07:30.666
what is wrong with becoming

130
00:07:30.666 --> 00:07:34.041
attached to achieving that goal?

131
00:07:34.041 --> 00:07:35.500
Decisions in the workplace

132
00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:39.166
often become clouded –

133
00:07:39.166 --> 00:07:41.666
not from a lack of skill,

134
00:07:41.666 --> 00:07:46.750
but from too much attachment.

135
00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:49.166
Attachment to your own opinion.

136
00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:54.083
Attachment to how others, see you.

137
00:07:54.083 --> 00:07:57.958
Attachment to a specific outcome.

138
00:07:57.958 --> 00:07:59.625
But tell Me,

139
00:07:59.625 --> 00:08:01.000
if your mind

140
00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:05.083
is already fixed on how things should go,

141
00:08:05.083 --> 00:08:07.541
or how your decisive

142
00:08:07.541 --> 00:08:12.958
personality should appear,

143
00:08:12.958 --> 00:08:13.708
how can you

144
00:08:13.708 --> 00:08:17.000
think with clarity?

145
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.083
Vairagya does not mean

146
00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:23.958
you stop caring.

147
00:08:23.958 --> 00:08:28.833
It means you care enough

148
00:08:28.833 --> 00:08:33.000
to do your part sincerely,

149
00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:37.041
but not so much that your identity

150
00:08:37.041 --> 00:08:41.000
or peace depends on

151
00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:46.208
how things turn out.

152
00:08:46.208 --> 00:08:51.000
When you let go of excessive attachment,

153
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.083
your mind becomes lighter

154
00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:57.291
and your thinking sharper.

155
00:08:57.291 --> 00:09:01.291
You let go of the need to always be right,

156
00:09:01.291 --> 00:09:06.041
so you actually begin to listen to what is better.

157
00:09:06.041 --> 00:09:09.000
You stop fearing criticism,

158
00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.916
so you become more open

159
00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:13.416
to feedback.

160
00:09:13.416 --> 00:09:15.250
And you stop worrying

161
00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:19.375
about success or failure,

162
00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:24.500
so your energy goes into doing the work,

163
00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.291
not into worrying about it.

164
00:09:26.291 --> 00:09:29.041
Equanimity gives you strength,

165
00:09:29.041 --> 00:09:32.250
not the kind that dominates,

166
00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:35.791
but the kind that supports.

167
00:09:35.791 --> 00:09:38.041
When you remain steady

168
00:09:38.041 --> 00:09:41.833
in both praise and pressure,

169
00:09:41.833 --> 00:09:46.416
you become the kind of decision-maker

170
00:09:46.416 --> 00:09:49.541
people trust.

171
00:09:49.541 --> 00:09:53.166
A professional with a calm mind
and clear detachment

172
00:09:53.166 --> 00:09:56.791
stands apart,

173
00:09:56.791 --> 00:10:00.250
not only for their achievements,

174
00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:04.083
but for how they lead.
